{"uid":"3d59b6eb90bf2d35","name":"test_admin_api_requires_login[总览]","fullName":"test_cases.admin.test_admin_authz#test_admin_api_requires_login","time":{"start":1793177194541,"stop":1793177194548,"duration":7},"description":"不带 token 调管理接口 → 401。\n\n    这一层挡的是\"完全没登录的人\"。它是 403 之外的另一道门：\n      401 = 我不知道你是谁  → 该去登录\n      403 = 我知道你是谁，但你不够格 → 登了也没用\n    两者混用是常见 bug（把未登录也返回 403），所以分开验。\n\n    ⚠️ 实测：全站 401 都是**空响应体**，不是 JSON 信封。\n       所以这里断\"响应体为空\"，而不是去 resp.json() —— 那样会抛 JSONDecodeError，\n       报错指向\"解析失败\"，掩盖了真正要验的东西。\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>不带 token 调管理接口 → 401。</p>\n<pre><code>这一层挡的是&quot;完全没登录的人&quot;。它是 403 之外的另一道门：\n  401 = 我不知道你是谁  → 该去登录\n  403 = 我知道你是谁，但你不够格 → 登了也没用\n两者混用是常见 bug（把未登录也返回 403），所以分开验。\n\n⚠️ 实测：全站 401 都是**空响应体**，不是 JSON 信封。\n   所以这里断&quot;响应体为空&quot;，而不是去 resp.json() —— 那样会抛 JSONDecodeError，\n   报错指向&quot;解析失败&quot;，掩盖了真正要验的东西。\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"api","time":{"start":1793177194451,"stop":1793177194451,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"hasContent":false,"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_auth_state","time":{"start":1793177194451,"stop":1793177194512,"duration":61},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[{"uid":"1152cbbdf721bad7","name":"→ 请求　POST /auth/login","source":"1152cbbdf721bad7.txt","type":"text/plain","size":297},{"uid":"15a9800c8c569c22","name":"← 响应　200 /auth/login","source":"15a9800c8c569c22.txt","type":"text/plain","size":699}],"parameters":[],"hasContent":true,"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":2,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_cleanup_guard","time":{"start":1793177194451,"stop":1793177194451,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"hasContent":false,"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"a